The '''Troglof''' were a rare [[Sentience|sentient]] [[species]] with tentacle-like [[Limb|arms]] native to [[Troglofa]]. A diminutive species, the Troglof had a pleasant natural odor. Troglofs could also move their eyestalks independently. [[Thamm]] was a Troglof who worked as a croupier in the [[Canto Casino and Racetrack|Canto Casino]] in the [[city]] of [[Canto Bight]].<ref name="USWNE" /> Another Troglof worked as a spa attendant and waiter at the [[Skull Ridge Mountain Hotel & Spa]] on [[Lanupa]].<ref name="You Have a Lot">{{SkeletonCrew|You Have a Lot to Learn About Pirates}}</ref>

